WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.131
At this rate, people are going
to end up being eaten by demons.

00:00:05.171 --> 00:00:07.196
That's what
Director Shiraishi said.

00:00:08.742 --> 00:00:12.508
And he called me a symbiont.

00:00:12.545 --> 00:00:13.534
Lieutenant!

00:00:13.580 --> 00:00:15.480
What's going on!?

00:00:15.515 --> 00:00:17.107
What does he mean "symbiont"?

00:00:19.919 --> 00:00:23.116
To put it into words,
this pattern is a mark.

00:00:23.156 --> 00:00:26.751
It shows that they exist
inside you.

00:00:26.793 --> 00:00:28.818
Exist inside?

00:00:28.862 --> 00:00:30.159
They do?

00:00:30.196 --> 00:00:32.630
Right. Inside us.

00:00:32.665 --> 00:00:34.792
That's why we're symbionts.

00:00:34.834 --> 00:00:38.702
At the same time, it's also the only
power that can defeat them.

00:00:40.407 --> 00:00:44.503
Shindo, you have a mark
like this too, right?

00:00:45.311 --> 00:00:48.644
But I'll leave the final decision
up to you.

00:00:48.681 --> 00:00:50.649
Of whether you awaken it or not.

00:00:50.683 --> 00:00:55.052
Lf... I get taken over...

00:00:55.088 --> 00:00:57.556
Then we'll have no choice.

00:02:42.428 --> 00:02:43.417
Really!

00:02:43.463 --> 00:02:44.725
No way! Really?

00:02:47.033 --> 00:02:48.057
No way.

00:02:48.101 --> 00:02:49.261
That's surprising!

00:02:49.302 --> 00:02:50.963
And then, and then...

00:02:55.308 --> 00:02:58.471
Big brother, is it okay if I come
watch your next tournament?

00:02:59.412 --> 00:03:01.141
I'm sure you'll beat everyone.

00:03:01.181 --> 00:03:04.048
After all, there isn't anyone
that can beat you, big brother!

00:03:05.051 --> 00:03:07.019
That's the first time
I've heard that!

00:03:07.053 --> 00:03:08.281
Oh yeah?

00:03:08.321 --> 00:03:09.379
Me too.

00:03:29.342 --> 00:03:30.331
Hey!

00:03:59.439 --> 00:04:01.202
Ami!

00:04:39.012 --> 00:04:40.001
Ami.

00:04:54.494 --> 00:04:56.621
Inukai's has been injured.

00:04:56.663 --> 00:04:57.823
I've heard.

00:04:57.864 --> 00:05:01.356
We believe that it will take
a long time for him to recover.

00:05:01.401 --> 00:05:03.164
It says in the report
that he was injured...

00:05:03.202 --> 00:05:05.830
...by something
he had already killed.

00:05:05.872 --> 00:05:10.241
We have no doubt that its power
has increased.

00:05:10.276 --> 00:05:12.710
We don't have any more time.

00:05:12.745 --> 00:05:14.906
The gate is continuing
to grow larger...

00:05:14.947 --> 00:05:17.916
...and will eventually swallow up
the apartment complex.

00:05:17.950 --> 00:05:21.113
We predict that at this rate,
we will end up in a grave situation.

00:05:22.789 --> 00:05:24.086
Counselor Ogata!

00:05:24.123 --> 00:05:27.092
Please give us permission to awaken
Ranmaru Shindo right away!

00:05:27.126 --> 00:05:29.390
Have you confirmed that he wants
to do this himself?

00:05:29.429 --> 00:05:31.556
There is no need to worry
about that.

00:05:33.666 --> 00:05:36.032
The timing is bad,
Inspector Ibuki.

00:05:36.069 --> 00:05:37.468
What?

00:05:37.503 --> 00:05:38.993
The higher-ups are reluctant.

00:05:39.038 --> 00:05:41.563
You can't... Councilor!

00:05:41.607 --> 00:05:45.168
There is a lot going on in places
you don't know about.

00:05:45.211 --> 00:05:48.180
But we believe that it would be
difficult to fight...

00:05:48.214 --> 00:05:51.047
...the now stronger Number Twelve
without Inukai.

00:05:51.084 --> 00:05:53.848
And if a new phantom appears...

00:05:55.755 --> 00:05:57.382
There is one condition.

00:05:57.423 --> 00:05:58.481
What?

00:05:58.524 --> 00:06:00.458
Test Ranmaru Shindo.

00:06:00.493 --> 00:06:01.482
Test him?

00:06:02.628 --> 00:06:05.426
Have him fight a phantom
without being awakened.

00:06:05.465 --> 00:06:08.696
But there's the danger
that he'll be killed!

00:06:08.735 --> 00:06:10.669
But he's already survived once.

00:06:11.938 --> 00:06:13.929
And he's a symbiont.

00:06:13.973 --> 00:06:16.737
Either way, we'll obtain a part.

00:06:18.344 --> 00:06:20.835
One of the 108 parts, that is.

00:06:22.682 --> 00:06:24.377
There is no other way.

00:06:36.462 --> 00:06:38.020
Inukai.

00:06:38.064 --> 00:06:41.500
It's surprising that Inukai got hurt.

00:06:43.336 --> 00:06:44.394
What do we do?

00:06:44.437 --> 00:06:46.530
We have no choice.

00:06:46.572 --> 00:06:50.201
For now, we'll have to do the work
by ourselves.

00:06:50.243 --> 00:06:51.642
About him...

00:06:51.677 --> 00:06:53.167
Shindo?

00:06:53.212 --> 00:06:55.680
I wasn't able to get permission.

00:06:55.715 --> 00:06:59.173
I wonder why the higher-ups
are reluctant at this point.

00:06:59.218 --> 00:07:03.552
But I was able to get him officially
transferred to the second division.

00:07:04.590 --> 00:07:05.921
Hmm.

00:07:05.958 --> 00:07:08.392
Well, I don't really know
how you did it, but that works.

00:07:08.428 --> 00:07:10.623
Besides, it looks like
he's all for that, too.

00:07:10.663 --> 00:07:11.891
You told him everything, right?

00:07:11.931 --> 00:07:14.161
Yes. Everything he needs
to know, that is.

00:07:14.200 --> 00:07:17.761
In that case, I'll go and talk to him
myself later.

00:07:17.804 --> 00:07:19.101
In my usual way.

00:07:19.138 --> 00:07:20.127
Stop it!

00:07:21.374 --> 00:07:24.605
So she says,
Miss Inspector Ibuki.

00:07:24.644 --> 00:07:25.633
Sakura.

00:07:40.159 --> 00:07:42.218
So demons really do exist...

00:07:42.261 --> 00:07:44.195
So you were here after all.

00:07:44.230 --> 00:07:46.130
Hanazono?

00:07:46.165 --> 00:07:48.292
They say you came back
in the morning yesterday.

00:07:48.334 --> 00:07:49.995
W-Why do you know that?

00:07:50.036 --> 00:07:51.060
There's a rumor going around.

00:07:51.103 --> 00:07:52.092
What?

00:07:52.138 --> 00:07:55.699
Your late-night date with Lieutenant
Suzuka from the second division!

00:07:55.741 --> 00:07:59.404
Jeez, man, how many women do you
need to have a good time with...

00:07:59.445 --> 00:08:01.242
...until you're satisfied?

00:08:01.280 --> 00:08:03.009
You're going to pay for this
eventually, man.

00:08:03.049 --> 00:08:05.040
Hmph. Let them say
whatever they want.

00:08:05.084 --> 00:08:08.952
By the way... h-how's
your younger sister doing?

00:08:08.988 --> 00:08:12.389
Oh, you mean Saya?
She's the same as always.

00:08:12.425 --> 00:08:14.120
She really chewed me out
yesterday...

00:08:14.160 --> 00:08:16.651
...because I came back
in the morning.

00:08:16.696 --> 00:08:19.028
She even set a curfew for me.

00:08:19.065 --> 00:08:21.192
Damn it, I am not a kid.

00:08:21.234 --> 00:08:22.895
R-Really.

00:08:22.935 --> 00:08:27.599
So is she going out
with anyone?

00:08:27.640 --> 00:08:28.834
Who knows?

00:08:28.875 --> 00:08:31.070
Now that you mention it, I've never
heard her say anything about it.

00:08:31.110 --> 00:08:32.600
R-Really?

00:08:32.645 --> 00:08:34.840
Hey, how about we go grab
some grub?

00:08:34.881 --> 00:08:36.212
My treat.

00:08:36.249 --> 00:08:38.581
Huh? Sure.

00:08:38.618 --> 00:08:41.416
But I also have the lunch
that Saya made for me.

00:08:41.454 --> 00:08:45.049
I see. Don't worry,
I'll eat that for you.

00:08:45.091 --> 00:08:48.117
H-Hey, you're acting
a little weird.

00:08:48.160 --> 00:08:49.320
Sergeant Shindo!

00:08:50.429 --> 00:08:51.691
I-Inspector Ibuki!

00:08:51.731 --> 00:08:53.596
There's no need to salute.

00:08:53.633 --> 00:08:56.966
Shindo, I want you to come
with me for a bit.

00:08:57.003 --> 00:08:57.992
Do you have time?

00:08:58.037 --> 00:08:59.265
Y-Yes, ma'am.

00:08:59.305 --> 00:09:01.034
Then let's talk
while we have lunch.

00:09:01.073 --> 00:09:02.062
Sure.

00:09:04.911 --> 00:09:07.471
Sorry, but I'm going
to borrow him.

00:09:11.551 --> 00:09:14.076
Jeez, what is it about him?

00:09:14.120 --> 00:09:16.213
You've got to be kidding me!

00:09:16.255 --> 00:09:17.244
Ow!

00:09:24.096 --> 00:09:25.563
Sakura!

00:09:25.598 --> 00:09:26.792
Ami.

00:09:29.802 --> 00:09:32.669
Hey, why are you always alone?

00:09:32.705 --> 00:09:36.766
Let's go hang out with everyone else!
That would be more fun!

00:09:36.809 --> 00:09:39.403
Okay.
That's all right.

00:09:41.948 --> 00:09:44.746
Oh, big brother!

00:09:44.784 --> 00:09:46.775
Welcome home!

00:09:49.789 --> 00:09:52.155
Bye-bye, Sakura!

00:09:52.191 --> 00:09:53.215
Let's go!

00:10:02.702 --> 00:10:05.637
Thank you very much for lunch.
It was delicious.

00:10:05.671 --> 00:10:08.504
Really? That's good.

00:10:08.541 --> 00:10:11.339
You're quite amazing, Inspector.

00:10:11.377 --> 00:10:13.777
Do you always eat
at restaurants like that?

00:10:13.813 --> 00:10:16.043
Of course not.
Today is special.

00:10:16.082 --> 00:10:17.106
Really?

00:10:17.149 --> 00:10:21.108
But I'd better keep today
a secret from Saya.

00:10:21.153 --> 00:10:23.246
And there's the lunch
she made, too.

00:10:23.289 --> 00:10:25.484
Saya... is your younger sister?

00:10:25.524 --> 00:10:27.048
Y-Yes...

00:10:27.093 --> 00:10:28.151
Siblings.

00:10:28.194 --> 00:10:32.654
She's just like a demanding wife.
She's annoying, so annoying.

00:10:32.698 --> 00:10:34.757
Huh?
How do you know about her?

00:10:34.800 --> 00:10:38.861
I'm envious of you.
I don't have any siblings.

00:10:38.904 --> 00:10:41.338
R-Right.

00:10:42.541 --> 00:10:45.305
Okay, I'm going
to head back by taxi.

00:10:45.344 --> 00:10:47.141
Um... Inspector Ibuki.

00:10:47.179 --> 00:10:48.168
Yes?

00:10:48.214 --> 00:10:50.808
Wasn't there something you wanted
to talk to me about?

00:10:50.850 --> 00:10:52.249
Don't worry about it today.

00:10:52.284 --> 00:10:53.751
We'll get to it the next time
we have a chance to talk.

00:10:53.786 --> 00:10:55.117
Okay.

00:11:02.428 --> 00:11:03.690
Whoa!

00:11:03.729 --> 00:11:05.890
Miss, this is a big one!

00:11:05.931 --> 00:11:07.296
It can't be.

00:11:08.601 --> 00:11:10.796
Number Thirteen.

00:11:10.836 --> 00:11:12.895
You've got good timing, don't you?

00:11:12.938 --> 00:11:14.269
Help me!

00:11:37.029 --> 00:11:38.462
Stop sniveling!

00:11:38.497 --> 00:11:40.727
Get the police to cordon this up
right away!

00:11:40.766 --> 00:11:45.135
Listen, don't let
a single person through!

00:11:46.605 --> 00:11:49.597
We are as of yet unable to ascertain
the suspect's image.

00:11:49.642 --> 00:11:52.008
One group of the police
has suggested

00:11:52.044 --> 00:11:54.342
that this may be connected to
the scattered body part murders.

00:11:54.380 --> 00:11:56.780
Tachikawa's really into it today,
isn't he?

00:11:56.816 --> 00:12:00.445
Heh, thank goodness it's under
their jurisdiction this time!

00:12:00.486 --> 00:12:03.683
But they might call us
for backup.

00:12:03.723 --> 00:12:06.624
The culprits are probably those
monsters.

00:12:06.659 --> 00:12:09.560
So when we get there,
the Tokko guys will just show up!

00:12:09.595 --> 00:12:10.584
True enough!

00:12:10.629 --> 00:12:13.860
So, how did it go, you playboy?

00:12:13.899 --> 00:12:14.888
What?

00:12:14.934 --> 00:12:16.458
Don't give me "what", man.

00:12:16.502 --> 00:12:18.902
This time you went out with that
beauty from the Tokko,

00:12:18.938 --> 00:12:20.667
Inspector Ibuki!

00:12:20.706 --> 00:12:22.970
Jeez, guys like you are so...

00:12:23.008 --> 00:12:25.499
Hey, don't you think
it's strange?

00:12:25.544 --> 00:12:26.568
What is?

00:12:26.612 --> 00:12:29.445
Why in the world are we here?

00:12:29.482 --> 00:12:30.471
Huh?

00:12:30.516 --> 00:12:31.574
Our organization
was established...

00:12:31.617 --> 00:12:33.244
...to deal with the recent increase
of bewildering crimes.

00:12:33.285 --> 00:12:39.246
The indiscriminate and atrocious
terrorist acts, right?

00:12:39.291 --> 00:12:41.725
But... in the end,
we're not doing anything.

00:12:41.761 --> 00:12:42.750
Huh?

00:12:42.795 --> 00:12:44.160
What do you mean?

00:12:44.196 --> 00:12:46.130
We're going to horrible crime scenes
full of corpses...

00:12:46.165 --> 00:12:47.530
...that we have to bring in!

00:12:47.566 --> 00:12:49.090
But that's all.

00:12:49.135 --> 00:12:50.568
The local police
handle the normal cases...

00:12:50.603 --> 00:12:52.070
...and the scattered body part
murder case...

00:12:52.104 --> 00:12:53.469
...is taken care of by Tokko.

00:12:53.506 --> 00:12:56.998
Shindo, what are you saying?

00:12:57.042 --> 00:12:59.510
There's just... no end to it.

00:13:00.880 --> 00:13:02.939
I applied to the S.M.F.
In order to get revenge...

00:13:02.982 --> 00:13:05.143
...on the one responsible
for the Machida murders.

00:13:05.184 --> 00:13:09.917
But I haven't actually done
anything important yet.

00:13:09.955 --> 00:13:13.322
It always feels like there's
something getting in the way.

00:13:44.023 --> 00:13:47.220
It looks like we've taken care
of most of them.

00:13:47.259 --> 00:13:48.749
Sakura!

00:13:50.129 --> 00:13:51.187
It's just a scratch.

00:13:55.467 --> 00:13:57.628
It really is difficult
with just the two of you.

00:14:00.339 --> 00:14:01.738
They're all ghouls, aren't they?

00:14:01.774 --> 00:14:03.833
The primary isn't here.

00:14:03.876 --> 00:14:06.743
At any rate, it looks like we're
going to have to take care of it...

00:14:06.779 --> 00:14:08.770
...before it finishes maturing.

00:14:08.814 --> 00:14:11.374
Hey, did you see him?

00:14:11.417 --> 00:14:12.406
I did.

00:14:12.451 --> 00:14:13.941
And?

00:14:13.986 --> 00:14:15.180
I didn't tell him.

00:14:16.388 --> 00:14:17.377
Oh my.

00:14:17.423 --> 00:14:19.948
But whatever happened
to Ibuki the demon?

00:14:19.992 --> 00:14:21.323
A sudden bout of compassion?

00:14:21.360 --> 00:14:24.329
That's not it.
I just hate waste.

00:14:24.363 --> 00:14:25.352
Waste?

00:14:25.397 --> 00:14:27.592
It would be a waste
to bring Ranmaru Shindo...

00:14:27.633 --> 00:14:29.157
...into the second division
right now.

00:14:29.201 --> 00:14:30.600
What do you mean?

00:14:30.636 --> 00:14:31.762
He'll just get killed.

00:14:33.339 --> 00:14:34.636
I see...

00:14:34.673 --> 00:14:37.073
That's something the higher-ups
would think up, isn't it?

00:14:37.109 --> 00:14:40.670
And that way, no matter
which one dies, they get a part.

00:14:40.713 --> 00:14:43.807
It might be
a dangerous gamble for us...

00:14:43.849 --> 00:14:48.183
...but it's a low-risk gamble
from the higher-ups' point of view.

00:14:48.220 --> 00:14:50.381
When we went on our date...

00:14:50.422 --> 00:14:53.482
...he tasted a lot more
like them, after all.

00:14:55.294 --> 00:14:56.283
Stop messing around!

00:14:56.328 --> 00:14:58.592
Jeez, I'm just kidding.

00:15:00.199 --> 00:15:01.461
Are you all right?

00:15:01.500 --> 00:15:02.524
That hurt.

00:15:04.203 --> 00:15:06.637
Could it be that she...

00:15:06.672 --> 00:15:08.071
Maybe.

00:15:10.576 --> 00:15:13.602
But I'll leave the final decision
up to you.

00:15:13.646 --> 00:15:16.080
On whether you awaken it or not.

00:15:16.115 --> 00:15:20.552
What in the world
is "awakening"?

00:15:20.586 --> 00:15:22.076
- Big brother.
- Huh?

00:15:22.121 --> 00:15:23.418
Phone for you...

00:15:23.455 --> 00:15:26.083
Are you all right?
You don't look so good.

00:15:26.125 --> 00:15:27.820
I'm all right.

00:15:27.860 --> 00:15:29.555
Yes, hello?

00:15:29.595 --> 00:15:32.155
This is Ranmaru Shindo, yes?

00:15:32.197 --> 00:15:34.529
Yes, it is.

00:15:34.566 --> 00:15:35.555
And you are?

00:15:35.601 --> 00:15:39.799
I am sorry, but I cannot reveal
my name for certain reasons.

00:15:39.838 --> 00:15:43.706
Actually, I want to answer
your questions.

00:15:43.742 --> 00:15:44.800
My questions?

00:15:44.843 --> 00:15:46.003
That's right.

00:15:46.045 --> 00:15:48.536
The questions you're
thinking of right now.

00:15:48.580 --> 00:15:49.979
Who are you?

00:15:50.015 --> 00:15:51.846
There's no need to worry.

00:15:51.884 --> 00:15:54.785
I'm a friend.

00:15:54.820 --> 00:15:59.382
Ever since you joined the S.M.F.,
you've started having questions.

00:15:59.425 --> 00:16:01.393
Right?

00:16:01.427 --> 00:16:03.918
And you're wondering about
the mysterious power...

00:16:03.963 --> 00:16:05.897
...dwelling inside of you.

00:16:05.931 --> 00:16:09.765
People would call it a demon.

00:16:09.802 --> 00:16:12.965
I'm someone who is in a position
to know these things.

00:16:13.672 --> 00:16:16.505
Don't you want to know the truth?

00:16:16.542 --> 00:16:19.875
Well, I can't trust you yet.

00:16:20.946 --> 00:16:23.540
That's reasonable.

00:16:23.582 --> 00:16:25.948
But let me give you a hint.

00:16:25.985 --> 00:16:29.944
I know who killed your parents.

00:16:29.989 --> 00:16:30.978
What!?

00:16:31.023 --> 00:16:34.254
I really am sorry
about what happened.

00:16:34.293 --> 00:16:40.664
I want to help you
with your revenge.

00:16:40.699 --> 00:16:41.961
Why you!

00:16:42.001 --> 00:16:43.400
Who are you!?

00:16:45.404 --> 00:16:49.397
Big brother, what's going on?
Why are you yelling?

00:16:52.177 --> 00:16:54.168
Saya, I'm going out for a bit.

00:16:54.213 --> 00:16:57.307
Big brother, where are you going
at a time like this?

00:16:57.349 --> 00:16:58.782
Shut up!

00:17:11.463 --> 00:17:13.863
They're coming from this hole?

00:17:16.635 --> 00:17:19.433
My parents were also killed
by those things.

00:17:19.471 --> 00:17:21.063
Just like yours.

00:17:21.907 --> 00:17:24.933
That's right,
you have the power.

00:17:24.977 --> 00:17:28.572
The only power that can
defeat those things.

00:17:31.583 --> 00:17:33.016
Damn it, let me go!

00:17:42.661 --> 00:17:44.458
Damn it, let go!

00:17:44.496 --> 00:17:46.225
God damn it!

00:17:46.265 --> 00:17:47.391
Why you...

00:17:47.433 --> 00:17:49.458
Don't mess with me!

00:18:02.381 --> 00:18:05.544
Damn, but you guys
are persistent!

00:18:06.652 --> 00:18:09.314
You don't seem to be the same
as the ones...

00:18:09.354 --> 00:18:11.322
...I ran into at the crime lab.

00:18:11.356 --> 00:18:12.755
Fine by me!

00:18:23.802 --> 00:18:27.795
So you guys really are the ones...

00:18:27.840 --> 00:18:29.432
...who killed my parents
back then.

00:18:44.890 --> 00:18:46.221
I'll kill you!

00:19:59.998 --> 00:20:02.626
Shindo... are you all right?

00:20:02.668 --> 00:20:04.795
Yeah, somehow.

00:20:06.038 --> 00:20:09.804
Why are you here, Rokujo?

00:20:09.841 --> 00:20:11.240
You weren't at home...

00:20:11.276 --> 00:20:13.642
...so I thought you might be here.

00:20:18.917 --> 00:20:22.045
Thanks. You saved me.

00:20:27.960 --> 00:20:30.258
He doesn't seem very friendly.

00:20:30.295 --> 00:20:31.557
It can't be helped.

00:20:31.597 --> 00:20:32.894
Hmm?

00:20:32.931 --> 00:20:34.899
You probably don't remember...

00:20:34.933 --> 00:20:38.027
...but he lived
in apartment building B.

00:20:38.070 --> 00:20:39.833
He lived here in Machida, too?

00:20:41.173 --> 00:20:42.902
Inukai had a younger sister.

00:20:42.941 --> 00:20:44.135
A younger sister?

00:20:44.176 --> 00:20:47.577
But... on that day...

00:20:59.258 --> 00:21:01.419
She was taken away?

00:21:01.460 --> 00:21:05.692
Even now, we don't know
if she's alive or dead.

00:21:06.798 --> 00:21:13.226
Inukai has always blamed himself
for not being able to protect her.

00:21:13.272 --> 00:21:15.968
But it's not his fault.

00:21:16.008 --> 00:21:19.603
But there's a chance
she's alive, right?

00:21:19.645 --> 00:21:24.605
Kureha has said that it
might have been easier on Inukai...

00:21:24.650 --> 00:21:27.551
...if she had been killed then.

00:21:27.586 --> 00:21:30.521
Shindo, why are you here?

00:21:30.555 --> 00:21:32.147
I got a phone call.

00:21:32.190 --> 00:21:33.555
A phone call?

00:21:33.592 --> 00:21:35.583
I don't know who it was.

00:21:35.627 --> 00:21:39.119
But they told me to come here.

00:21:39.164 --> 00:21:42.691
I'm sure it was Special Security.
They were trying to test you.

00:21:42.734 --> 00:21:43.758
Test me?

00:21:43.802 --> 00:21:47.135
By making you fight
Number Thirteen.

00:21:47.172 --> 00:21:51.074
It might be... that they were
trying to kill you.

00:21:51.109 --> 00:21:53.839
No, it wasn't Special Security.

00:21:53.879 --> 00:21:54.868
What?

00:21:54.913 --> 00:21:58.178
The man on the phone said he wanted
to show me the truth.

00:21:58.216 --> 00:21:59.877
The truth?

00:21:59.918 --> 00:22:02.443
And that he wanted to help me
get my revenge.

00:22:11.129 --> 00:22:13.597
Shindo, I have a favor to ask!

00:22:14.599 --> 00:22:18.626
Don't get involved with us,
not ever again!

00:22:40.659 --> 00:22:45.426
I held that hand

00:22:45.464 --> 00:22:50.401
And we kissed

00:22:50.435 --> 00:22:55.202
After a little while

00:22:55.240 --> 00:23:00.109
It will quietly become
our final day

00:23:00.145 --> 00:23:06.573
Please, no matter what,
never forget

00:23:07.819 --> 00:23:10.219
Sherry, far away

00:23:10.255 --> 00:23:12.655
Sherry, it was with you

00:23:12.691 --> 00:23:17.594
That I laughed

00:23:17.629 --> 00:23:19.995
Sherry, far away

00:23:20.031 --> 00:23:22.431
Sherry, it was you

00:23:22.467 --> 00:23:27.097
That I held

00:23:27.139 --> 00:23:29.437
I sung the memories

00:23:29.474 --> 00:23:31.965
Forever melodies

00:23:32.010 --> 00:23:34.240
I sung the memories

00:23:36.982 --> 00:23:39.314
I sung the memories

00:23:39.351 --> 00:23:41.842
Forever melodies

00:23:41.887 --> 00:23:44.082
I sung the memories

00:23:47.125 --> 00:23:49.355
Sherry, far away

00:23:49.428 --> 00:23:51.896
Sherry, far away

00:23:51.930 --> 00:23:58.859
I know you can find
my melodies

00:23:59.938 --> 00:24:02.307
Next Episode Preview

00:24:02.307 --> 00:24:04.867
Next Episode Preview
And now he knows everything.

00:24:06.111 --> 00:24:09.239
I won't ever regret this.

00:24:09.281 --> 00:24:11.806
It looks like you're ready.

00:24:13.118 --> 00:24:15.609
This is... a ritual.

00:24:17.422 --> 00:24:19.549
On the next episode of Tokko:

00:24:20.625 --> 00:24:22.058
Awakening.

00:24:25.030 --> 00:24:29.899
Awakening
